# XSETTINGS daemon config, read by xsettingsd(1) and served to GTK/Qt clients.
#
# Why this exists: pointer size reaches apps by three different routes on this
# box, and only this one works on a *running* app.
#
#   ~/.Xresources (Xcursor.*)      -> i3's own windows and Xt-era clients
#   XCURSOR_SIZE in the environment -> i3's root-window cursor, read at startup;
#                                      set in ~/.desktop-session/desktop-session.conf
#   XSETTINGS (this file)           -> GTK/Qt clients, and they react live
#
# Keep the values in step with .Xresources, both GTK files and the environment.
# Deliberately limited to the cursor: DPI and font rendering already arrive via
# Xft.dpi in ~/.Xresources and ~/.config/fontconfig/fonts.conf, and restating
# them here would risk applying a second time on top of those.
Gtk/CursorThemeName "Adwaita"
Gtk/CursorThemeSize 128
